experiment: salrew
  instrument        salrew   trial seed 0000000001357de7   1200000 ticks
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  the reward     Warlaumont & Finnegan (2016): praise when auditory
                 SALIENCE clears a bar that ratchets on the creature's
                 own hit rate. No target anywhere.
  the primary    NOT salience -- the SYLLABLE-BAND MODULATION DEPTH of
                 the produced envelope (sd of the 2-6 Hz band over its
                 mean). Salience can rise by getting louder or noisier
                 and neither is a syllable. `salience` measured this
                 creature at 94% of a real 3 Hz frame already, so the
                 cheap way up is the likely one.
  the control    YOKED praise -- the taught arm's reward TIMES replayed
                 to a fresh creature. Identical rate, timing and total
                 dopamine; only the CONTINGENCY differs. `none` cannot
                 do that job.
  constants      band tau = 1/(2 pi f) at 6 and 2 Hz = 26.5 / 79.6 ms;
                 staircase step 2.22%% of the bar, which is Warlaumont's
                 +0.1 on 4.5 as a RATE because their scale is not ours;
                 their 30%%-of-10 advance rule taken verbatim; the bar
                 starts at each creature's OWN median over 20 windows.
