    salience drift    +0.04 +/- 0.15  (+0.3 SE)   <- the reward's own measure

  --- the reading ---
  REFUSED -- syllable-band modulation depth does not beat yoked praise
  (+0.1 SE, 3.0 required). Salience moved +0.3 SE, so the reward is
  landing and the creature is not becoming rhythmic: at 94% of a real
  frame already, it had a cheaper way up. Warlaumont's reward is not
  refuted -- what is refused is that it installs a frame in THIS larynx,
  which has no jaw and, per `no-sequence`, no module that holds a kick
  for 10 ms.
